  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">• Brand introduction:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; Kumo Home, a furniture brand with over 30 years of design innovation.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">Our mission is to bring beauty to your home. Whether that be through our products, a space we've designed, or even a simple recipe on our blog, we want to inspire you to elevate your everyday rituals.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">• Product description: <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Kumo chair is a harmonious blend of comfort and style, crafted for those who appreciate the balance of form and function. Its plush, rounded seat and supportive backrest, upholstered in a soft boucle fabric, offer a welcoming embrace, ensuring relaxation without compromising on design. The chair's graceful curves are complemented by sturdy walnut wood legs, adding a touch of timeless elegance to this modern piece. Perfect for any space, the Kumo chair is designed to be both a comfortable haven and a stylish statement.</span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">• Payment terms: <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Paypal/Credit Card/ApplePay</span></span><br><br></p></div>",
